{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bf83f76f3c50ddac","name":"Hunting Blaster Carbine","source":{"id":"source:reference-bf83f76f3c50ddac","title":"Hunting Blaster Carbine","revision":20194,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:23:17Z","sha256":"5f4a5dc57c21721affa84a22b0c14656f83e220596b8e334a661884a35c64800","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20194","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hunting%20Blaster%20Carbine&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bf83f76f3c50ddac","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Hunting Blaster Carbine combines the reduced weight and portability of a carbine with the ability to take down a target quickly. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," bounty hunter ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chak","referenceId":"reference:05dcd045af5c1a0e"}," carries a Hunting Blaster Carbine. A Hunting Blaster Carbine is incapable of making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attacks, but on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},", a Hunting Blaster Carbine's damage dice change from d8s to d10s. Hunting Blaster Carbines have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Retractable Stocks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Retractable_Stocks"},". Like all carbines, the Hunting Blaster Carbine can be used to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," even if its stock is not folded.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Hunting Blaster Carbine requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 50 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2.1 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
